NaryCyclicTag"},
   "WebLink",
   BaseStyle->{"Notes"}]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a9e90ba6-b50d-4091-bdf3-16d9ec836e78"],
 ". It is retrieved the first time it is used."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->521335428,ExpressionUUID->"a2cce3ae-b9fd-44ce-9c2e-e8e4923125dd"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "An ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["n", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "7d0bbc52-58a6-4bc6-8466-021e520fef67"],
 "-ary cyclic tag system works on a tape, which is a list of the symbols 0, \
1, \[Ellipsis], ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["n", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "e420dc28-3155-499d-a0ed-6a7a0b6d683e"],
 "-1."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->39283519,ExpressionUUID->"4c1d8513-47fa-4e1a-b42f-61a0a58bf251"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Each ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["rulei", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "769b14f1-0251-4dc0-ac99-a06946a4d6f3"],
 " is a list ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["w0", "TI"], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["w1", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{",", " ", "\[Ellipsis]"}], "}"}]}]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "c4e04a60-99a6-4463-a762-93cd890be5cf"],
 " of appendants. Each appendant ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["ws", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "57d4610c-107c-4099-803a-20ffc7379e73"],
 " is a list of symbols."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->279955860,ExpressionUUID->"819c287c-d4c7-4407-9e24-77e355b221bf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "At each step, the first symbol ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["s", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "8c6f739c-8483-4d11-b823-7653b2a31b9d"],
 " is removed from the tape, and the appendant ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["ws", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "af57fb68-9f00-46ce-a324-9c86c13d5c7b"],
 " of the current rule is added to the end of the tape."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->723538001,ExpressionUUID->"6549206e-270d-4ded-91af-3d493cf451b3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["rulei", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "9df5f6ba-8da1-4ddb-aada-fc923c548b9e"],
 " are used in turn, one at each step, starting again from ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["rule1", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "2f41640a-5490-4306-ace0-52ff4cb989f0"],
 " after the last one."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->614269972,ExpressionUUID->"d5d17923-2854-4314-87ac-6d0de4a4657b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A rule with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "658dc0a7-dd03-4ee5-befb-9f51b23c1ab4"],
 " appendants gives appendants for the symbols 0 through ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "4dffa4ae-26e3-42c9-83a2-e88d49b2ce30"],
 "-1. Rules can have different lengths, as long as each rule has an appendant \
for every symbol that is at the start of the tape when the rule is used."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->583189011,ExpressionUUID->"a6732aab-4998-47c8-9d18-ec01a121ce45"],

Cell["\<\
An appendant can be empty. The tape is then one symbol shorter after the step.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->405725213,ExpressionUUID->"fa7246c8-fbbd-45c0-a741-8747d9267bb4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["init", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "a96d262f-3708-4f78-b574-f1f14a5296b8"],
 " must be a list of nonnegative integers. It can be empty."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->552375982,ExpressionUUID->"f8a1877b-779c-42b6-bdb3-b1786406eed8"],

Cell["The following properties can be given:", "Notes",
 CellID->490511496,ExpressionUUID->"3db64c46-245c-4754-a2be-2a57e5b215ca"],

Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon",ExpressionUUID->
     "f4029d26-9a00-45f5-8103-578fcf4409d5"], Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<States\>\""], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "28cc8b66-026c-4314-95d0-88959524c283"], Cell[
